{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27263","headline":"蜀中赠广上人 · 章孝标","name":"蜀中赠广上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾持麈尾引金根，万乘前头草五言。\n疏讲青龙归禁苑，歌抄白雪乞梨园。\n朝惊云气遮天阁，暮踏猨声入劒门。\n今日西川无子美，诗风又起浣花村。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}